  {
   "name": "Roles and Responsibilities",
   "contentIndex": 91,
   "rows": 7,
   "columns": 2,
   "columnWidthsPT": [
    225,
    258.75
   ],
   "borderAllSides": {
    "widthPT": 1,
    "color": "#000000",
    "dashStyle": "SOLID"
   },
   "rowsDetail": [
    {
     "minRowHeightPT": 24.75,
     "cells": [
      {
       "text": "Roles",
       "backgroundColor": "#CCCCCC",
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "Responsibilities",
       "backgroundColor": "#CCCCCC",
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "minRowHeightPT": 130.265625,
     "cells": [
      {
       "text": "Senior Management and Board of Directors\n(the \u201cBoard\u201d)",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "The Board is ultimately accountable for the prevention of bribery and corruption and has overall accountability for the AML/CTF control framework. The Board has appointed the Managing Director as the individual who sits on the Board of Directors, as the officer responsible for Altery\u2019s compliance with the 2017 Money Laundering Regulations (\u201c2017 MLRs\u201d) as amended.\n\nSenior Management and the Board are responsible for activity promoting and encouraging a culture of compliance throughout Altery, demonstrating a clear \u2018tone from the top\u2019 that Altery will not tolerate non compliance.",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "minRowHeightPT": 96.75,
     "cells": [
      {
       "text": "\u201cAppointed Board Level Committee\u201d",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "Overseeing internal and external audit functions.\nEnsuring compliance with regulatory requirements and other relevant laws.\nManaging the company\u2019s risk management framework, including the development and monitoring of risk appetite.\nReviewing and approving compliance and risk management policies.",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "minRowHeightPT": 96.75,
     "cells": [
      {
       "text": "Money Laundering Reporting Officer (MLRO)",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "The MLRO oversees Altery\u2019s compliance with applicable anti\u2011bribery and anti\u2011corruption systems and controls, and reports to the Board on their operation and effectiveness. The MLRO also responds promptly to any reasonable requests for information from relevant regulatory or law enforcement authorities.",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "minRowHeightPT": 95.25,
     "cells": [
      {
       "text": "1st Line of Defence - 1LOD",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "The 1LOD owns the bribery and corruption risk posed by Altery\u2019s customer base. The first line functions are responsible for developing and implementing operational procedures to ensure the requirements of this Policy are met.",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "minRowHeightPT": 95.25,
     "cells": [
      {
       "text": "2nd Line of Defence - 2LOD",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "The 2LOD ensures that the Altery Fraud Prevention Policy principles are applied consistently across business operations, including monitoring of fiat activities, conducts periodic reviews and escalates any significant risks and supports investigations into customer outcomes.",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "minRowHeightPT": 105.75,
     "cells": [
      {
       "text": "All Employees",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "Employees must report any suspicions of bribery and corruption, in a timely manner, to the MLRO through the designated reporting channel. Failure to do so may lead to disciplinary and legal action including criminal penalties and/or substantial fines. All employees are required to read this Policy, attest to it on an annual basis and adhere to this Policy in their day to day activities.",
       "backgroundColor": null,
       "paddingPT": {
        "left": 5,
        "right": 5,
        "top": 5,
        "bottom": 5
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
